Ke `vpertov kata7iw 03ne `3mac : t3c akro `acewc tov `ajiov evajjeliov: kvrion ke ton 0eon `3mwn: `iketevcwmen cofi`a or0i `akovcwmen tov `ajiov evajjeliov.
